{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0564_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9c8e32659419acf0f4dcb05e50bae985b533c326aeba528c4bbd048ffd420230", "ja": "（MVを撮影した後、インタビューを受けていた\nジュリアが戻ってきたが……機嫌が良さそうに見える）", "zh": "（拍摄完MV后，接受采访的茱莉亚回来了……看起来心情很不错。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0564_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "5295c82d28e88e888934f9e9fc7105ced3a46a7ea6b1fe1640567de3dde59bd5", "ja": "待たせたな、{$P$}。\n楽しくて、つい予定より長く喋っちゃってさ。", "zh": "久等啦，{$P$}。\n聊得太开心，不知不觉就比预定时间讲得更久了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0564_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "e224801333ef80caf7ffe9311f4b7a6585530eeffac5b941d6812976041bdf8f", "ja": "ちょっと熱が入りすぎたっていうか……\nでも、お陰で初心に帰れた気がするよ。", "zh": "好像有点太投入了……\n不过，多亏了你，我感觉自己找回了初心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0564_1003_p", "source_sha256": "9599b8025b272f0e70e5dc3e42a500f34d3ce584aa11d248fd1a0f5b393bbc33", "ja": "全然、気にしてないよ。\nそれよりも、何を話してきたかの方が気になるな。", "zh": "我完全没在意。\n比起这个，我更想知道你们都聊了些什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0564_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "276acdf16769bc0f471e69ab97ef4e6a91e8ba96268b248988feb34fcfe1c3bd", "ja": "ああ……えっと。あたしがロック好きになった、\n最初のきっかけについて聞かれたんだけど。", "zh": "啊……那个。有人问起了我最初喜欢上摇滚的契机。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0564_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "1b559b05bf56f1d06d11b17e0c1ba53d8712f005de84d2ea277ae73dfd89ae0f", "ja": "前にも話したっけ？　あたしのじいちゃんと\nばあちゃんが、バンド好きでさ。", "zh": "之前说过吗？我爷爷和奶奶很喜欢乐队。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0564_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "c589a7484577cf142ad08d5a007cabe861567dfb6cd43577059c54440b7a33d9", "ja": "小さい頃、ふたりの家でレコードを聞いたのが始まり。\nそれが今のあたしに繋がってるんだ。", "zh": "小时候在他们家里听唱片，就是一切的开端。\n那段经历一直延续到了现在的我身上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0564_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2159ee036608342bc1818807aeede815618542ff76074ec7c06b6fa5590d40ae", "ja": "そうだったのか。そのレコード、\nよっぽどジュリアの心に響いたんだな。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。那张唱片，一定深深打动了茱莉亚的心吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0564_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "5bb2ef19ed459595e0a3a84de108fb6fd888a1f26c020328b231a28635c2fe04", "ja": "そりゃもう、恥ずかしいぐらいに響いたよ。\n曲に合わせて、ギターの弾きマネをしたりしてさ……。", "zh": "那当然，触动得都让我觉得不好意思了。还跟着歌曲做起弹吉他的动作来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0564_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "881b95faf031e3c004cfcf375bb10d868a712229dbc620ee6a93a2bf6877574a", "ja": "じいちゃんにギターを買ってもらって、ちゃんと\n弾くようになって。それからは、色々あったな。", "zh": "爷爷给我买了把吉他，我开始认真弹起了吉他。之后嘛，也经历了各种各样的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0564_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "437646bfaf3fffc02cfe815ae96c6d106166811450b4e210d0c43079c82e6f02", "ja": "何せ、バンドをやってたはずが\n今じゃアイドルになってるしな？", "zh": "毕竟，本来应该是在组乐队的，结果现在却成了偶像，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0564_1011_p", "source_sha256": "f302cd6c69a5c727b12ca6d0a276eb51157b1c2da5b4eb26e52435bc31a9ccad", "ja": "はは、確かにそうだな。\n伝えたかった事は、伝えられたか？", "zh": "哈哈，确实是这样。想传达的事情，都传达出去了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0564_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "1545fbdca03a2df76ee8878d2f99e46d9240bef87560f18ef96ebe70e6e423b4", "ja": "ああ。\nいや、多分だけど。", "zh": "啊。\n不过，也许吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0564_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "7fd865145d0af2deba4042a5286647a67af25b29c34f6dc14cee792f15e560d6", "ja": "言いたかったことが全部伝わったかどうかは、\n正直なところ、あたしにもわからない。ただ……。", "zh": "想说的话有没有全部传达出去，说实话，我自己也不知道。不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0564_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "a7fdc1206cc468c03c830a34cc244f78ee0b199dc31f1f2207f2525e715f8ea2", "ja": "読んでくれた誰かの心に、何かが響いたら、\nそれでいいかなって。", "zh": "如果能让读到这些的某个人心里有所触动，那样就够了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0564_1015_p", "source_sha256": "01dfbf0b9b426403d7e3c47d2de07ddc85c0a0a0b965e56d5cc1b02ef261ac69", "ja": "うん。", "zh": "嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0564_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "7ab2502523c1eb7da9adbb23f3f30730914aec2f0f145d2d98f6212dad7322e2", "ja": "あたしみたいに、音楽で、人生が\n丸ごと変わっていく可能性だってあるしな。", "zh": "像我这样，也有可能因为音乐而彻底改变人生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0564_1017_p", "source_sha256": "8539d563b774bc7964b67934d45fe214ea926b946cd1e4d926c648e51b706e38", "ja": "そうだな。俺がジュリアと出会えたのも、\n元を辿れば、一枚のレコードのお陰って事だもんな。", "zh": "是啊。我能遇见茱莉亚，追根溯源也是因为一张唱片啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0564_1018_p", "source_sha256": "f7b9f83b4c3a03e5f4fae70727cf42e766854ca260dc88c7c4d995c22587f2b9", "ja": "音楽に背中を押されたジュリアが、違う誰かの\n背中を押すかもしれない。それは素敵な事だと思うよ。", "zh": "被音乐推了一把的茱莉亚，也许也会去推动另一个人。那一定是件很棒的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0564_1019_050jul", "source_sha256": "281ac954325aca60629df84f2667fd092b05d14717999b00bfbe38812c321e1a", "ja": "ま、夢を追うかどうかは人それぞれだけどな。でも、\n絶対に悪いことにはならないって、あたしが保証する。", "zh": "嘛，要不要追逐梦想因人而异。不过，我可以保证，绝对不会变成什么坏事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0564_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "e0cf856ab9f1c84e027887f66e7e450c313df22c26b5f37da3ad0b35b282fa9a", "ja": "結果がどうなったとしても……本気で\n向き合った時間は、最高の思い出になるからな！", "zh": "不管结果如何……\n认真面对过的这段时光，都会成为最棒的回忆！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0564_1021_p", "source_sha256": "b9a24be220165d30d59f589134e53ada4761b0b71b7a5cc8bff8160f938afc11", "ja": "（ジュリアの晴れやかな表情を見れば、誰もが\n納得するだろう。その言葉に、嘘が一切ない事を）", "zh": "看到茱莉亚那晴朗的表情，任谁都会相信，她说的那番话绝无半点虚假。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
